{"id":"vod_bf_37098","vodId":"37098","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"无彩限的怪灵世界","name_cn":"无彩限的怪灵世界","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-38/530be40b32a339232eda7ead36075775.jpg"},"summary":"在这个世界上，存在着一种名为“怪灵”的生物。故事发生在弗塞亚学院之中，在那里，设立了名为“脑机能异常对策室”的机构，专门解决怪灵带来的危险和麻烦。一条晴彦（下野紘 配音）是一年级新生，亦是对策室的成员，他拥有能够使用绘画封印怪灵的能力，是足智多谋的军师。　　川神舞（上坂堇 配音）是一条晴彦的学姐，个性开朗行事冲动的她常常惹出不少的麻烦，和晴彦组成了搭档相互取长补短居然格外的般配。除此之外，温文尔雅的千金大小姐和泉玲奈（早见沙织 配音），特立独行的孤高展示水无濑小系（内田真礼 配音），这些孩子们集结在一起，为了保护他们挚爱的朋友和家园向怪灵发起了宣战。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:50:41","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wucaixiandeguailingshijie/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wucaixiandeguailingshijie/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wucaixiandeguailingshijie/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wucaixiandeguailingshijie/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wucaixiandeguailingshijie/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wucaixiandeguailingshijie/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wucaixiandeguailingshijie/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wucaixiandeguailingshijie/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wucaixiandeguailingshijie/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wucaixiandeguailingshijie/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wucaixiandeguailingshijie/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wucaixiandeguailingshijie/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.